{
 "_createdAt": "2026-04-27T18:26:23Z",
 "_id": "wp-post-157835-en",
 "_rev": "5rHAuzJFIHfimDH2xHmkyF",
 "_type": "article",
 "_updatedAt": "2026-11-09T18:01:12Z",
 "author": {
  "_ref": "author-legacy-archive",
  "_type": "reference"
 },
 "body": [
  {
   "_key": "000000000001",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000000",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "When entering Egypt by private aircraft, the airport isn't just an arrival point."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000003",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "lwhovin9j6f7",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Where you land changes the next several hours significantly. Into central "
    },
    {
     "_key": "l2gdvv8u22r5",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "09i7be74vjz0"
     ],
     "text": "Cairo"
    },
    {
     "_key": "yyaxeyhzl1ro",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ". Direct to the "
    },
    {
     "_key": "qzhvh0jqhwyn",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "fo0q1e7fm8zd"
     ],
     "text": "Giza"
    },
    {
     "_key": "3x180lny7u8s",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": " pyramids. Starting from a "
    },
    {
     "_key": "8u24ni6900xh",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "cblmx2sch13p"
     ],
     "text": "Luxor temple"
    },
    {
     "_key": "1vjkrotdjmhv",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ". Into the southern Nile at "
    },
    {
     "_key": "vaks1kr64kjv",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "jpe7s8uzwzom"
     ],
     "text": "Aswan"
    },
    {
     "_key": "61rmixf201ch",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ". To a Red Sea or Sinai resort."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_key": "09i7be74vjz0",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "wp-page-83284",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    },
    {
     "_key": "fo0q1e7fm8zd",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "wp-page-58854",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    },
    {
     "_key": "cblmx2sch13p",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "guideArticle.luxor.the-luxor-temple",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    },
    {
     "_key": "jpe7s8uzwzom",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "wp-page-58758",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    }
   ],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000005",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000004",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "On commercial flights, you usually enter Cairo first, then move by domestic flight or car. With a private aircraft, you can think the other way. Choose the arrival airport to match the trip's destination."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000007",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000006",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Closer isn't always better. Confirm airport operations, handling, fuel, permits, runway, immigration, and ground transfer."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000009",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000008",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Cairo International Airport"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000000b",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000000a",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Cairo International is Egypt's largest and most capable airport."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000000d",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000000c",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "For larger aircraft, complex itineraries, late-night arrivals, crew arrangements, fuel, VIP handling, and backup support, the first candidate. Many handling companies are experienced with private-aircraft ground support, with operational reassurance."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000000f",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000000e",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Natural for central Cairo, Zamalek, Nile-side, Islamic Cairo, and business-purpose stays. Easy as the first base for multi-city trips."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000011",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000010",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "The weak point is distance from Giza. Depending on traffic, transfers from the airport to the pyramids or Grand Egyptian Museum take time. No issue for a Cairo-wide trip; if Giza is the only purpose, a closer option exists."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000013",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000012",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Sphinx International Airport"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000015",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000014",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Sphinx International is strong toward Giza."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000017",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000016",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "If the main purpose is the Giza pyramids, the Grand Egyptian Museum, Saqqara, Dahshur, or west Cairo, ground transfer is shorter than from Cairo International. Especially rational for trips that see the pyramids, stay one night, then fly to the next destination."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000019",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000018",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Don't treat it as a complete substitute for Cairo International in every operation. For larger aircraft, complex handling, special support, or backup needs, confirm in detail with experienced handlers in advance."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000001b",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000001a",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Sphinx is strong for simple Giza-focused arrivals. For complex aviation operations, Cairo International can be more reassuring."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000001d",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "lfbrv66a1w4e",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "bldusytdzgrp"
     ],
     "text": "Luxor"
    },
    {
     "_key": "ut0xu6nvzd87",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": " International Airport"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_key": "bldusytdzgrp",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "wp-page-58877",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    }
   ],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000001f",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000001e",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "If Luxor is the trip's centre, going directly into Luxor International carries large value."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000021",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "bqvwleuwvxhi",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "The "
    },
    {
     "_key": "jggd1ybpc4tg",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "6ikk6wu9m9j8"
     ],
     "text": "Valley of the Kings"
    },
    {
     "_key": "p0qns0g84h2o",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ", Karnak, Luxor Temple, Hatshepsut, "
    },
    {
     "_key": "gpukkdbghiy6",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "bcaoadqwi7uw"
     ],
     "text": "Medinet Habu"
    },
    {
     "_key": "8965257pdn0v",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ". All relatively close to the airport. Compared with entering Cairo, clearing customs, and connecting by domestic flight to Luxor, direct arrival's meaning is clear."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_key": "6ikk6wu9m9j8",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "guideArticle.luxor.valley-of-the-kings",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    },
    {
     "_key": "bcaoadqwi7uw",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "guideArticle.luxor.madinat-habu-temple",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    }
   ],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000023",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000022",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Luxor suits travellers led by Upper Egyptian history. Useful too as a Nile cruise start or end airport."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000025",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000024",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "The airport isn't on Cairo's scale, but charter and VIP handling are possible. Aircraft size, fuel, handling, operating hours, customs, and immigration are items the handler should confirm in advance."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000027",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000026",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Aswan International Airport"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000029",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000028",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Aswan International is the airport for entering the southern Nile."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000002b",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "aqeguwhvz75l",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "9vjnqbzepkro"
     ],
     "text": "Philae Temple"
    },
    {
     "_key": "9xghzah69rjg",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ", "
    },
    {
     "_key": "usgh4x4hyh49",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "2plxhhlyoatl"
     ],
     "text": "the Unfinished Obelisk"
    },
    {
     "_key": "ofyk1a5pqqi8",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ", Nubian villages, Old Cataract, Lake Nasser, "
    },
    {
     "_key": "utnq068nuv2x",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "ysba6bsnysg8"
     ],
     "text": "Abu Simbel"
    },
    {
     "_key": "arfgfzuyqi2x",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ". The trip's character differs from Luxor. Not a high-density temple city — an airport for the river, islands, desert, and the southern Nubian air."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_key": "9vjnqbzepkro",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "guideArticle.aswan.the-philae-temple",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    },
    {
     "_key": "2plxhhlyoatl",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "guideArticle.aswan.the-unfinished-obelisk",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    },
    {
     "_key": "ysba6bsnysg8",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "wp-page-56813",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    }
   ],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000002d",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000002c",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Useful as the trip's endpoint or starting point. After a Nile cruise, departing from Aswan is a natural pattern. Conversely, enter Aswan directly, see Abu Simbel and Philae, then move north."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000002f",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000002e",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Abu Simbel isn't close to Aswan city. By road, it's a long transfer; even using air, a separate arrangement is needed. For private or charter to include Abu Simbel, have the specialist handler confirm runway, permits, ground support, and local transfer."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000031",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "ug45civfybx2",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "wleg2vrmdqio"
     ],
     "text": "Hurghada"
    },
    {
     "_key": "be45fhixxox5",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": " International Airport"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_key": "wleg2vrmdqio",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "wp-page-58859",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    }
   ],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000033",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000032",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Hurghada International is the gateway to the mainland Red Sea side."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000035",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "bg2xxeuf4dam",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "For Hurghada, "
    },
    {
     "_key": "p7dac6il7z6n",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "cckne81seftq"
     ],
     "text": "El Gouna"
    },
    {
     "_key": "qto5byr2ktxa",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ", Sahl Hasheesh, Soma Bay, and "
    },
    {
     "_key": "kgthv14bxrah",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "ysrqb5h9mpnh"
     ],
     "text": "Safaga"
    },
    {
     "_key": "r3n6etcjp6kp",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ", this is practical. For diving, resort stays, and Red Sea coast holidays, there isn't much reason to enter through Cairo."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_key": "cckne81seftq",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "wp-page-58740",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    },
    {
     "_key": "ysrqb5h9mpnh",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "wp-page-58920",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    }
   ],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000037",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000036",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Commercial flight volume is large and the airport is used to international leisure. Private-aircraft handling is relatively easy too."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000039",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000038",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "The note is that Hurghada is an airport for the Red Sea. To see pyramids, Cairo, and Luxor, plan where you enter and where you exit as a whole. Enter Hurghada, spend several days on the Red Sea, then continue by road or air to Luxor — a possible shape, but read transfer time realistically."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000003b",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000003a",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Sharm el-Sheikh International Airport"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000003d",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000003c",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Sharm el-Sheikh International is the airport for southern Sinai."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000003f",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000003e",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "For Ras Mohammed, the Strait of Tiran, Red Sea diving, resort stays, and Mount Sinai or St. Catherine's area, a natural gateway. The airport is used to international leisure, and private aviation handling is relatively organised."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000041",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000040",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Sharm is geographically cut off from other parts of Egypt. Combining with Cairo or Luxor needs a separate flight segment. If entering Sharm, make Sinai stay an explicit purpose."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000043",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000042",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "For inland Sinai movement, confirm permits, transit times, and security conditions. Not a problem solved by airport choice alone."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000045",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000044",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Choose by itinerary"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000047",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000046",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "For central Cairo, business, Islamic Cairo, or the museum, Cairo International."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000049",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000048",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "For Giza pyramids, the Grand Egyptian Museum, Saqqara, or Dahshur, Sphinx International."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000004b",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000004a",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "For the Valley of the Kings, Karnak, Luxor's west bank, or Nile cruise start, Luxor International."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000004d",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000004c",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "For Aswan, Philae, Nubia, Abu Simbel, or Nile cruise end, Aswan International."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000004f",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000004e",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "For mainland Red Sea resorts, Hurghada International."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000051",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000050",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "For southern Sinai and diving, Sharm el-Sheikh International."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000053",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000052",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "The best airport isn't the largest. It is the one that wastes least ground transfer and lies closest to the trip's purpose."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000055",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000054",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Different entry and exit airports"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000057",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000056",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "For private aviation, varying entry and exit airports is very effective."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000059",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000058",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "For example, arrive at Sphinx and see Giza, move to Luxor, and depart from Aswan after a Nile cruise. Or, finish business in Cairo, fly to Hurghada to rest on the Red Sea, and exit from there."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000005b",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000005a",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Egypt is long north to south, with sites spread out. Fix arrival and departure to the same airport and a final loop-back transfer creeps in. Private aviation's value lies in reducing that waste."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000005d",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000005c",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Even for domestic legs, permits, handling, fuel, crew time, and airport acceptance need confirmation. Have the operator or handler build the whole itinerary together."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000005f",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000005e",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "What to confirm in advance"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000061",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000060",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Before deciding an airport, items to confirm with the handler."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000063",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000062",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Landing permit and submission deadline. Aircraft size and runway condition. Parking availability. Fuel supply. Customs and immigration. VIP lounge or dedicated flow. Crew accommodation and movement. Ground-vehicle access conditions. Alternate airports for delay or weather."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000065",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000064",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Cairo, Hurghada, and Sharm have operational depth. Luxor, Aswan, and Sphinx are usable, with the importance of advance confirmation higher."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000067",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000066",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Don't estimate Egyptian lead times short. Even regular flights should be locked in days ahead; for complex operations, larger aircraft, diplomatic/VIP work, and around holidays, hold more margin."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000069",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000068",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "In sum"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000006b",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000006a",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "What matters for a private arrival into Egypt isn't the airport name."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000006d",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000006c",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "What do you see first. How many minutes by car after arrival. Stay overnight, or fly again straight away. Aircraft and airport conditions matched. Handling with margin."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000006f",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000006e",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Sphinx for Giza. Cairo for the capital. Luxor for ancient Thebes. Aswan for the southern Nile. Hurghada for the mainland Red Sea. Sharm for Sinai."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000071",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000070",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Thinking this way makes airport choice quite clear."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000073",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000072",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "The advantage of private aviation isn't only arriving faster. It is being able to start the trip from the place you actually want to see."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  }
 ],
